{"status":"success","movie":{"id":"a32c3d8a7646c36579606201a633154b","name":"V\u0169 L\u00e2m Linh","slug":"vu-lam-linh","original_name":"Zhan Zhao Adventures","thumb_url":"https:\/\/phim.nguonc.com\/public\/images\/Post\/10\/vu-lam-linh.jpg","poster_url":"https:\/\/phim.nguonc.com\/public\/images\/Post\/10\/vu-lam-linh-1.jpg","created":"2026-05-13T15:48:49.000000Z","modified":"2026-05-15T13:27:41.000000Z","description":"Nam hi\u1ec7p Tri\u1ec3n Chi\u00eau (D\u01b0\u01a1ng D\u01b0\u01a1ng) v\u00ec truy t\u00ecm manh m\u1ed1i v\u1ec1 v\u1ee5 m\u01b0u ph\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a T\u01b0\u01a1ng D\u01b0\u01a1ng V\u01b0\u01a1ng do c\u1ed1 nh\u00e2n \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i m\u00e0 m\u1ed9t th\u00e2n m\u1ed9t m\u00ecnh xu\u1ed1ng ph\u00eda Nam. Tr\u00ean \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111i \u0111i\u1ec1u tra Tri\u1ec3n Chi\u00eau li\u00ean t\u1ee5c b\u1ecb truy s\u00e1t, l\u00fac n\u00e0y Tri\u1ec3n Chi\u00eau t\u00ecnh c\u1edd k\u1ebft b\u1ea1n v\u1edbi Ho\u1eafc Linh Lung (Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c Nam) \u0111ang tr\u00ean \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng h\u00e0nh t\u1ea9u giang h\u1ed3. \u0110\u1ec3 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 ch\u1ee9ng c\u1ee9 v\u1eb9n to\u00e0n, Tri\u1ec3n Chi\u00eau l\u1ea5y th\u00e2n m\u00ecnh l\u00e0m m\u1ed3i nh\u1eed k\u1ebb \u0111\u1ecbch, v\u00ec mu\u1ed1n c\u1ee9u gi\u00fap b\u00e1ch t\u00ednh m\u00e0 li\u00ean t\u1ee5c r\u01a1i v\u00e0o hi\u1ec3m c\u1ea3nh. Trong l\u00fac nguy c\u1ea5p, C\u1ea9m Mao Th\u1eed B\u1ea1ch Ng\u1ecdc \u0110\u01b0\u1eddng (Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng D\u1eadt Lu\u00e2n) \u0111\u00e3 ra tay t\u01b0\u01a1ng c\u1ee9u. Ba ng\u01b0\u1eddi li\u00ean th\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u tra manh m\u1ed1i, thu th\u1eadp t\u1ed9i ch\u1ee9ng T\u01b0\u01a1ng D\u01b0\u01a1ng V\u01b0\u01a1ng c\u1ea5u k\u1ebft v\u1edbi c\u1ea3 2 phe ch\u00ednh t\u00e0 \u00e1p b\u1ee9c d\u00e2n l\u00e0nh th\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ed3ng ngo\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ecbch. Cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng Tri\u1ec3n Chi\u00eau v\u00e0 b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 c\u00f9ng nhau \u0111\u1eadp tan \u00e2m m\u01b0u n\u01a1i tri\u1ec1u \u0111\u00ecnh l\u1eabn giang h\u1ed3, tr\u1ea3 l\u1ea1i ch\u00ednh kh\u00ed cho v\u00f5 l\u00e2m v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 b\u00ecnh y\u00ean cho b\u00e1ch t\u00ednh.","total_episodes":37,"current_episode":"T\u1eadp 7","time":"45 Ph\u00fat\/T\u1eadp","quality":"HD","language":"Vietsub + Thuy\u1ebft Minh","director":"L\u01b0u H\u1ed3ng Nguy\u00ean","casts":"Ch\u01b0\u01a1ng Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c Nam, Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng D\u1eadt Lu\u00e2n, D\u01b0\u01a1ng D\u01b0\u01a1ng","category":{"1":{"group":{"id":"c4ca4238a0b923820dcc509a6f75849b","name":"\u0110\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng"},"list":[{"id":"eccbc87e4b5ce2fe28308fd9f2a7baf3","name":"Phim b\u1ed9"},{"id":"0777d5c17d4066b82ab86dff8a46af6f","name":"Phim \u0111ang chi\u1ebfu"}]},"2":{"group":{"id":"1679091c5a880faf6fb5e6087eb1b2dc","name":"Th\u1ec3 lo\u1ea1i"},"list":[{"id":"c51ce410c124a10e0db5e4b97fc2af39","name":"Ch\u00ednh K\u1ecbch"},{"id":"1f0e3dad99908345f7439f8ffabdffc4","name":"B\u00ed \u1ea8n"},{"id":"a8baa56554f96369ab93e4f3bb068c22","name":"C\u1ed5 Trang"}]},"3":{"group":{"id":"8e296a067a37563370ded05f5a3bf3ec","name":"N\u0103m"},"list":[{"id":"7e7757b1e12abcb736ab9a754ffb617a","name":"2026"}]},"4":{"group":{"id":"67c6a1e7ce56d3d6fa748ab6d9af3fd7","name":"Qu\u1ed1c gia"},"list":[{"id":"c0c7c76d30bd3dcaefc96f40275bdc0a","name":"Trung Qu\u1ed1c"}]}},"episodes":[{"server_name":"Vietsub #1","items":[{"name":"1","slug":"tap-1","embed":"https:\/\/embed13.streamc.xyz\/embed.php?hash=66dbac251ec2aeca455f2439068e75df","m3u8":"https:\/\/sing.phimmoi.net\/66dbac251ec2aeca455f2439068e75df\/hls.m3u8"},{"name":"2","slug":"tap-2","embed":"https:\/\/embed12.streamc.xyz\/embed.php?hash=c7b530f292e66da4f322277ad461fe57","m3u8":"https:\/\/sing.phimmoi.net\/c7b530f292e66da4f322277ad461fe57\/hls.m3u8"},{"name":"3","slug":"tap-3","embed":"https:\/\/embed11.streamc.xyz\/embed.php?hash=6aa6d108bba9761e91d0a861254c679f","m3u8":"https:\/\/sing.phimmoi.net\/6aa6d108bba9761e91d0a861254c679f\/hls.m3u8"},{"name":"4","slug":"tap-4","embed":"https:\/\/embed13.streamc.xyz\/e